 Merret home, threatens his family and plans to kidnap his magical infant son; Merret stuns him with a nightmare spell before Grimbly overpowers him.","participants":["grimbly-wothis","merret"],"location":null,"importance":"major","page":"wiki/grimbly-wothis","order":1803,"story_date":"","storyline":"Murders at Karlov Manor","source":"mtg-wiki","paragraph":6,"quote":"briefly incapacitating Wothis with a nightmare spell","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Grimbly_Wothis#:~:text=briefly%20incapacitating%20Wothis%20with%20a%20nightmare%20spell","citation":{"source":"mtg-wiki","official":false,"publisher":"MTG Wiki contributors","work":"Grimbly Wothis","series":"MTG Wiki","authors":[],"date":"","url":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Grimbly_Wothis","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Grimbly_Wothis#:~:text=briefly%20incapacitating%20Wothis%20with%20a%20nightmare%20spell","archived":null,"license":"CC BY-NC-SA 4.0","text":"\"Grimbly Wothis\", section \"History\". MTG Wiki contributors, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0."}},{"id":"grimbly-wothis-e4","era":{"date":"2012-10-05","era":"rtr","label":"Return to Ravnica"},"summary":"Lazav reveals himself, sends Grimbly away with no memory, installs Aunt Bea and alters Merret and Tashi's memories.","participants":["lazav","grimbly-wothis","aunt-bea","merret","tashi"],"location":null,"importance":"major","page":"wiki/grimbly-wothis","order":1803,"story_date":"","storyline":"Murders at Karlov Manor","source":"mtg-wiki","paragraph":7,"quote":"Suddenly, Lazav revealed himself from the corner where he had been sitting all along.","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Grimbly_Wothis#:~:text=Suddenly%2C%20Lazav%20revealed%20himself,been%20sitting%20all%20along.","citation":{"source":"mtg-wiki","official":false,"publisher":"MTG Wiki contributors","work":"Grimbly Wothis","series":"MTG Wiki","authors":[],"date":"","url":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Grimbly_Wothis","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Grimbly_Wothis#:~:text=Suddenly%2C%20Lazav%20revealed%20himself,been%20sitting%20all%20along.","ar