y","authors":["Nicky Drayden"],"date":"2018-10-10","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/under-cover-fog-2018-10-10","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/under-cover-fog-2018-10-10#:~:text=How%27s%20this%20for%20confidence,your%20pay%20for%20today%3F","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Under the Cover of Fog\" by Nicky Drayden. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 10 Oct 2018."}},{"id":"under-cover-fog-2018-10-10-e2","era":null,"summary":"Merret barely thins the fog and reveals a Simic schooner cloaking itself, which Wothis uses as a selling point to the investor.","participants":["merret","grimbly-wothis"],"location":"ravnica","importance":"minor","page":"stories/under-cover-fog-2018-10-10","order":671,"story_date":"2018-10-10","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":10,"quote":"Fog swirls, barely, clearing about halfway to the other side of the river","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/under-cover-fog-2018-10-10#:~:text=Fog%20swirls%2C%20barely%2C%20clearing,side%20of%20the%20river","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Under the Cover of Fog","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nicky Drayden"],"date":"2018-10-10","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/under-cover-fog-2018-10-10","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/under-cover-fog-2018-10-10#:~:text=Fog%20swirls%2C%20barely%2C%20clearing,side%20of%20the%20river","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Under the Cover of Fog\" by Nicky Drayden. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 10 Oct 2018."}},{"id":"under-cover-fog-2018-10-10-e3","era":null,"summary":"Merret returns to his cramped home in Keyhole Village, where Tashi demands he find real food for the hungry baby.","participants":["merret","tashi","soche","merret-s-baby"],"location":"keyhole-village","importance":"minor","page":"stories/under-cover-fog-2018-10-10","order":671,"story_date":"2018-10-10","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":26,"quote":"Get the food, Merret. I don't care how.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/under-cover-fog-2018-10-10#:~:text=Get%20the%20food%2C%20Merret.%20I%20don%27t%20care%20how.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Under the Cover of Fog","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nicky Drayden"],"date":"2018-10-10","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/under-cover-fog-2018-10-10","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/under-cover-fog-2018-10-10#:~:text=Get%20the%20food%2C%20Merret.%20I%20don%27t%20care%20how.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Under the Cover of Fog\" by Nicky Drayden. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 10 Oct 2018."}},{"id":"under-cover-fog-2018-10-10-e4","era":null,"summary":"Failing to steal from a posh grocer, Merret breaks into Grimbly Wothis's apartment through an unlocked window.","participants":["merret"],"location":"ravnica","importance":"minor","page":"stories/under-cover-fog-2018-10-10","order":671,"story_date":"2018-10-10","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":30,"quote":"I round the building, make a quick hop to the balcony, and sure enough, find an unlocked window.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/under-cover-fog-2018-10-10#:~:text=I%20round%20the%20building%2C,find%20an%20unlocked%20window.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Under the Cover of Fog","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nicky Drayden"],"date":"2018-10-10","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/under-cover-fog-2018-10-10","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/under-cover-fog-2018-10-10#:~:text=I%20round%20the%20building%2C,find%20an%20unlocked%20window.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Under the Cover of Fog\" by Nicky Drayden. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 10 Oct 2018."}},{"id":"under-cover-fog-2018-10-10-e5","era":null,"summary":"Merret takes a loaf of bread and drinks drops of an Elixir of Focus from Wothis's kitchen.","participants":["merret","elixir-of-focus"],"location":"ravnica","importance":"major","page":"stories/under-cover-fog-2018-10-10","order":671,"story_date":"2018-10-10","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":36,"quote":"Just one more, for good measure.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/under-cover-fog-2018-10-10#:~:text=Just%20one%20more%2C%20for%20good%20measure.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Under the Cover of Fog","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nicky Drayden"],"date":"2018-10-10","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/under-cover-fog-2018-10-10","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/under-cover-fog-2018-10-10#:~:text=Just%20one%20more%2C%20for%20good%20measure.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Under the Cover of Fog\" by Nicky Drayden. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 10 Oct 2018."}},{"id":"under-cover-fog-2018-10-10-e6","era":null,"summary":"Wothis's wife enters the kitchen, and the elixir sharpens Merret's magic enough to make himself invisible to her.","participants":["merret","wothis-s-wife","elixir-of-focus"],"location":"ravnica","importance":"minor","page":"stories/under-cover-fog-2018-10-10","order":671,"story_date":"2018-10-10","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":38,"quote":"I draw on magic, and her mind opens up to me like a map.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/under-cover-fog-2018-10-10#:~:text=I%20draw%20on%20magic%2C,me%20like%20a%20map.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Under the Cover of Fog","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nicky Drayden"],"date":"2018-10-10","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/under-cover-fog-2018-10-10","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/under-cover-fog-2018-10-10#:~:text=I%20draw%20on%20magic%2C,me%20like%20a%20map.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Under the Cover of Fog\" by Nicky Drayden. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 10 Oct 2018."}},{"id":"under-cover-fog-2018-10-10-e7","era":null,"summary":"Empowered, Merret clears the whole harbor, then in a show-off moment casts a nightmare on the crane operator Yantis, dropping a crate of whiskey toward Wothis and the investor.","participants":["merret","yantis","grimbly-wothis"],"location":"ravnica","importance":"major","page":"stories/under-cover-fog-2018-10-10","order":671,"story_date":"2018-10-10","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":41,"quote":"Yantis screams, fighting all the terrifying nothings in front of him.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/under-cover-fog-2018-10-10#:~:text=Yantis%20screams%2C%20fighting%20all,in%20front%20of%20him.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Under the Cover of Fog","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nicky Drayden"],"date":"2018-10-10","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/under-cover-fog-2018-10-10","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/under-cover-fog-2018-10-10#:~:text=Yantis%20screams%2C%20fighting%20all,in%20front%20of%20him.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Under the Cover of Fog\" by Nicky Drayden. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 10 Oct 2018."}},{"id":"under-cover-fog-2018-10-10-e8","era":null,"summary":"Wothis shoves the investor into the river and jumps in as the crate smashes; Merret fears House Dimir will erase him.","participants":["grimbly-wothis","merret","house-dimir"],"location":"ravnica","importance":"minor","page":"stories/under-cover-fog-2018-10-10","order":671,"story_date":"2018-10-10","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":42,"quote":"Nope, there's nothing covert about ruining a thousand zinos worth of cargo.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/under-cover-fog-2018-10-10#:~:text=Nope%2C%20there%27s%20nothing%20covert,zinos%20worth%20of%20cargo.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Under the Cover of Fog","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nicky Drayden"],"date":"2018-10-10","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/under-cover-fog-2018-10-10","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/under-cover-fog-2018-10-10#:~:text=Nope%2C%20there%27s%20nothing%20covert,zinos%20worth%20of%20cargo.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Under the Cover of Fog\" by Nicky Drayden. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 10 Oct 2018."}},{"id":"under-cover-fog-2018-10-10-e9","era":null,"summary":"Merret's baby, healthy after gnawing elixir-stained bread, sneezes and every candle in the apartment ignites.","participants":["merret-s-baby","tashi","merret"],"location":"keyhole-village","importance":"major","page":"stories/under-cover-fog-2018-10-10","order":671,"story_date":"2018-10-10","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":45,"quote":"Then baby sneezes, and every single candle in our apartment bursts into flame.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/under-cover-fog-2018-10-10#:~:text=Then%20baby%20sneezes%2C%20and,apartment%20bursts%20into%20flame.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Under the Cover of Fog","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nicky Drayden"],"date":"2018-10-10","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/under-cover-fog-2018-10-10","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/under-cover-fog-2018-10-10#:~:text=Then%20baby%20sneezes%2C%20and,apartment%20bursts%20into%20flame.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Under the Cover of Fog\" by Nicky Drayden. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 10 Oct 2018."}},{"id":"under-cover-fog-2018-10-10-e10","era":null,"summary":"Wothis breaks into the apartment, beats Merret and demands the child, saying he saw the candle trick through the window.","participants":["grimbly-wothis","merret","tashi","merret-s-baby"],"location":"keyhole-village","importance":"major","page":"stories/under-cover-fog-2018-10-10","order":671,"story_date":"2018-10-10","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":51,"quote":"I saw what that child did through the window, the trick with the candles.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/under-cover-fog-2018-10-10#:~:text=I%20saw%20what%20that,trick%20with%20the%20candles.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Under the Cover of Fog","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nicky Drayden"],"date":"2018-10-10","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/under-cover-fog-2018-10-10","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/under-cover-fog-2018-10-10#:~:text=I%20saw%20what%20that,trick%20with%20the%20candles.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Under the Cover of Fog\" by Nicky Drayden. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 10 Oct 2018."}},{"id":"under-cover-fog-2018-10-10-e11","era":null,"summary":"Merret weaves a nightmare in Wothis's mind but loses focus when Wothis nears Soche, and Wothis seizes the baby.","participants":["merret","grimbly-wothis","soche","merret-s-baby"],"location":"keyhole-village","importance":"minor","page":"stories/under-cover-fog-2018-10-10","order":671,"story_date":"2018-10-10","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":55,"quote":"And like that, my baby is in Grimbly Wothis's arms","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/under-cover-fog-2018-10-10#:~:text=And%20like%20that%2C%20my,in%20Grimbly%20Wothis%27s%20arms","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Under the Cover of Fog","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nicky Drayden"],"date":"2018-10-10","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/under-cover-fog-2018-10-10","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/un